% The Little Elpier: the pond. Who lives here, and who eats whom.
% Every chapter accumulates this file. Chapter 5 explains the
% `kind`, `type` and `pred` lines; until then, read past them.

% ANCHOR: kinds
kind critter type.
% ANCHOR_END: kinds

% ANCHOR: critters
type algae, fly, snail, frog, fish, heron, duck, otter critter.
% ANCHOR_END: critters

% ANCHOR: eats
pred eats o:critter, o:critter.
eats snail algae.
eats fly   algae.
eats frog  fly.
eats frog  snail.
eats fish  fly.
eats fish  snail.
eats duck  snail.
eats duck  algae.
eats heron frog.
eats heron fish.
eats otter fish.
% ANCHOR_END: eats

% ANCHOR: habits
pred swims o:critter.
swims frog.
swims fish.
swims duck.
swims otter.

pred flies o:critter.
flies fly.
flies heron.
flies duck.

pred plant o:critter.
plant algae.
% ANCHOR_END: habits
